{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 61, :comments ["<b>And he called after their name</b> — After the name of the daughters, who were of the seed of Barzillai, he called his own name Barzillai." "<b>Of the daughters</b> — The meaning: one of his daughters. Similarly: 'and he was buried in the cities of Gilead' [i.e., in one of them]."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:42.202540524Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}